{
  "name": "weather report automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://wttr.in/YOUR_CITY?format=j1",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        -176,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "d35308e7-ae8a-4ca2-90d7-e18a1c67a085",
      "name": "weather Fetch"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "={{ $json.data }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=you are a data extractor and weather reporting assistance. I will give you raw JSON response from from a weather API. \n\nYor task: \n1. extract only the useful information\n2. ignore all unnecessary data\n3. create a short weather report \n\nextract these fields: - city - maximum temperature (maxtempC) - minimum temperature(mintempC) - chance of rain - weather condition description.\nthen create a friendly weather report.\n\nrules: start with \"Good Morning ☀️\" \nkeep it under 120 words, simple and human like tone, no JSON output, only final message \n\nHere is the date:\n\n{{ $json.data }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        48,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "21962927-6b76-46f9-a33e-27bd1620765a",
      "name": "Message a model"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "your-email@example.com",
        "subject": "Todays Weather Report",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.content.parts[0].text }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        416,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "064b415c-3133-4b97-bcbb-ad0167cc1e26",
      "name": "Send a message",
      "webhookId": "YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 6,
              "triggerAtMinute": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "bf7a4ba1-1de2-41fd-a4e6-28b6c830b2ec",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger"
    }
  ],
